-- forward: long text, the pattern occurs only at the end (many partial matches)
? match [A, A, B, A, B] [A, A, A, B, A, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, B]
-- forward, no occurrence (finite failure)
? match [A, A, B, A, B] [A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A, B, A, A]
-- backward: generate texts of length 7 containing the pattern
? match [A, A, B, A, B] [x1, x2, x3, x4, x5, x6, x7]
-- partially known text
? match [A, A, B, A, B] [A, A, x1, A, A, x2, A, x3]
